Each platform that this extension has been built to support should have a folder
in this directory containing its native code.

  windows/   — <project>.x86_64.dll, vcruntime140.dll, vcruntime140_1.dll
  linux/     — lib<project>.x86_64.so, lib<project>.arm64.so
  macos/     — lib<project>.x86_64.dylib, lib<project>.arm64.dylib
  ios/       — lib<project>.arm64.dylib
  android/   — lib<project>.arm64.so, lib<project>.x86_64.so

Folders are created automatically by `just build` when building for that platform.
